# The champion with the dive armed and blood-gated (dive 3, divecap 16,
# diveblood 3): a party of the three fastest gathered units closes on
# the nearest visible ground mover that outranges every land gun the
# army fields, drafted against the OPENING rung so it dives in time --
# but the first party is not raised until THREE of our units have died
# to the outranging guns sighted so far. The fourth reading of the
# draft brake (log 2026-09-13): the opening rung's early dive costs the
# champion's win on seeds where the line beats the battery unaided
# (dive16 and divecap13, three regressions each at any party budget),
# and the champion's own loss table separates those seeds from the
# openers by when the third unit dies to a gun -- before frame 110k on
# three of nine openers (two of them the dive's flips), on none of the
# four touched winners and one of thirty-five winners. The cap of
# sixteen selects the opening rung and stays above every flip's cost.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
